{% comment %}
  Animal for Animal Mission Section
{% endcomment %}

<section class="animal-mission-section">
  <div class="animal-mission-section__container">
    <div class="animal-mission-section__content">
      <span class="animal-mission-section__badge">An Initiative by Dear Me</span>
      <h2 class="animal-mission-section__title">
        At Dear Me, we firmly believe that humans are not separate from the animal kingdom; we are an integral part of
        it.
      </h2>

      <div class="animal-mission-section__text">
        <p class="animal-mission-section__paragraph">
          Yet, somewhere along the way, we forgot this connection and began to perceive ourselves as superior. Our
          mission is to remind the world that we are all fellow beings sharing this planet, and it's our responsibility
          to stand up for those who cannot speak for themselves.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .animal-mission-section {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    position: relative;
    background: #fef9f2 url('{{ 'noise.png' | asset_url }}');
    background-size: 150px 150px;
    background-repeat: repeat;
  }

  .animal-mission-section__container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 4rem;
  }

  .animal-mission-section__content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .animal-mission-section__badge {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    background: #fe5f78;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .animal-mission-section__title {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    color: #63001f;
    text-transform: none;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .animal-mission-section__text {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .animal-mission-section__paragraph {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
    color: #63001f;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Mobile responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .animal-mission-section {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }

    .animal-mission-section__container {
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }

    .animal-mission-section__title {
      font-size: 2.5rem !important;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .animal-mission-section__paragraph {
      font-size: 1.1rem !important;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .animal-mission-section__container {
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .animal-mission-section__title {
      font-size: 2rem !important;
    }

    .animal-mission-section__paragraph {
      font-size: 1rem !important;
    }
  }
</style>
